@startuml
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

enum EGameStateNet {
  Off
  Lobby
  Ready
  Loading
  Intro
  Game
  Outro
  Postgame
}

interface IGameState {
  +NetState : EGameStateNet
  +OnEnter(prev : IGameState)
  +OnExit(next : IGameState)
  +OnUpdate()
  +IsComplete() : bool
}

interface IGameFlowStrategy {
  +DecideNext(current : EGameStateNet, previous : EGameStateNet) : EGameStateNet
}

note right of IGameFlowStrategy
  previousを受け取ることで
  Loading後の遷移先を判断できる
  例:
  current=Loading, previous=Lobby  → Ready
  current=Loading, previous=Ready  → Intro
  current=Loading, previous=Outro  → Intro or PostGame
  current=Loading, previous=PostGame → Lobby
end note

class StateMachine {
  -current : IGameState
  -flow : IGameFlowStrategy

  +Initialize(initial : IGameState)
  +Update()
  +ChangeState(next : IGameState)
}

class GameStateManager <<NetworkBehaviour>> {
  -stateMachine : StateMachine
  -states : Dictionary<EGameStateNet, IGameState>
  -flowStrategy : IGameFlowStrategy

  +Current : EGameStateNet    [Networked]
  +Previous : EGameStateNet

  +Spawned()
  +FixedUpdateNetwork()
  +Server_SetState(state : EGameStateNet)
}

class OnlineRoundFlow {
  -maxRounds : int
  -currentRound : int
  +OnlineRoundFlow(maxRounds : int)
  +DecideNext(current, previous) : EGameStateNet
}

note right of OnlineRoundFlow
  デフォルト4ラウンド
  セッション作成時にmaxRoundsを注入
  Outro後: currentRound < maxRounds
    → Loading(→Intro)
  Outro後: currentRound >= maxRounds
    → PostGame
end note

class SingleRoundFlow
class LobbyState
class ReadyState
class LoadingState
class IntroState
class GamePlayState
class OutroState
class PostgameState

IGameState <|.. LobbyState
IGameState <|.. ReadyState
IGameState <|.. LoadingState
IGameState <|.. IntroState
IGameState <|.. GamePlayState
IGameState <|.. OutroState
IGameState <|.. PostgameState

IGameFlowStrategy <|.. OnlineRoundFlow
IGameFlowStrategy <|.. SingleRoundFlow

GameStateManager *-- StateMachine      : owns
GameStateManager *-- IGameFlowStrategy : owns
StateMachine     ..> IGameFlowStrategy : uses
StateMachine     ..> IGameState        : depends on
IGameState       --> EGameStateNet     : has value
@enduml
```

---

## `OnlineRoundFlow.DecideNext()`の動き（具体例）
```
DecideNext(Lobby,    _)        → Loading
DecideNext(Loading,  Lobby)    → Ready
DecideNext(Ready,    _)        → Loading
DecideNext(Loading,  Ready)    → Intro
DecideNext(Intro,    _)        → Game
DecideNext(Game,     _)        → Outro
DecideNext(Outro,    _)        → Loading   ※ラウンド未終了
                               → PostGame  ※全ラウンド終了
DecideNext(Loading,  Outro)    → Intro
DecideNext(PostGame, _)        → Loading
DecideNext(Loading,  PostGame) → Lobby